==================

FFmpeg — https://ffmpeg.org/
---------------------------
This application contains no FFmpeg code. It drives a locally installed FFmpeg binary
and (optionally) FFprobe through their command-line interface.

The FFmpeg binaries are NOT part of this repository. They are either downloaded on
demand by `tools/fetch-ffmpeg.ps1` or supplied by the user in `bin/ffmpeg/`.

Most prebuilt Windows packages (including the "essentials" builds from gyan.dev and
the gpl builds from BtbN) enable GPL components such as libx264/libx265, which makes
those *binaries* GPL-licensed. If you redistribute a package that bundles them, you
